{"type":"message","id":"029f312c","parentId":"776129e4","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:25:33.660Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-05-28 00:25 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 修改 `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py`，修复两个 bug：\n\n**Bug 1 — `close_all_positions()` (line 349) 传的 symbol 缺 USDT 后缀**\n当前代码：\n```python\nsymbol = pos['symbol']  # 拿到的是 \"SOL\" 不是 \"SOLUSDT\"\n```\n修复：传给 `place_order()` 时加回 USDT 后缀\n```python\nsymbol = pos['symbol'] + \"USDT\"\n```\n\n**Bug 2 — reduceOnly 被 Binance Testnet 拒单**\n在 `close_all_positions()` 中，调用 `place_order(symbol, side, qty, reduce_only=True)` 传了 reduce_only=True。\n但 Binance Testnet 对 SHORT 仓位平仓时（side=BUY）拒了 reduceOnly flag。\n修复：在 `close_all_positions()` 中调用 `place_order` 时不传 reduce_only（即去掉 reduce_only=True，或者改为 False）。\n\n这两个改动都很小，改完检查一下格式没问题就行。\n\n改完后还要做：\n3. 用 `manual_trade.py` 开一单测试：`python3 manual_trade.py open SOL SHORT 20 10 --confirm`（保证金20 USDT，10x杠杆）\n4. 验证开仓成功\n5. 然后用 `manual_trade.py close SOL --confirm` 平仓，验证平仓不再报错\n\n重要：修改完代码后不需要重启任何服务，直接执行 python 命令即可。"}],"timestamp":1779899133640}}
